# CHG-0446: `--doc` answers an item, a type (with its functions) and a
# misspelling (the nearest name). That every name the hints table offers for
# `T::name` is a function of some `std` type (CHG-0445) is
# checks/doc_matches_cobdoc.py's to check.
run $COBC --doc Vec::push
status 0
stdout-starts export fn Vec::push<T>
run $COBC --doc Vec
status 0
stdout-has The functions of `Vec`:
stdout-has Vec::len
run $COBC --doc Vec::psh
status 1
stderr-has did you mean `Vec::push`?
